flowchart TB
  Shell["Start here: human shell
owns the terminal"]:::start
  Driver["Grove driver
ignores SIGINT, catches TERM and HUP"]
  Ravel["ravel start-session
Grove's foreground job, own group"]
  Selection["Ravel-owned selection phase
terminal belongs to Ravel's group"]
  Harness["Managed harness
Ravel's child job, own group"]
  Tools["Descendants remaining
in managed group"]
  Shell -->|"1. Start driver"| Driver
  Driver -->|"2. Spawn ravel, hand its group the terminal"| Ravel
  Ravel -->|"3. Evaluate owner policy"| Selection
  Ravel -->|"4. Give terminal to managed job"| Harness
  Harness -->|"5. Spawn tools"| Tools
  Harness -.->|"6. end-session opaque argument"| Ravel
  Ravel -.->|"7. Cleanup and terminal restoration"| Harness
  Ravel -->|"8. Result after cleanup; Grove reaps and takes the terminal back"| Driver
  Driver -.->|"A caught TERM or HUP goes to ravel alone, never KILL"| Ravel
  classDef start fill:#163a57,color:#fff,stroke:#163a57,font-weight:bold
